    "paragraph": "A citizen science behavioural dataset captures 4,620 individual contribution decisions made by 462 participants during a ten-round collective-risk dilemma experiment on air pollution mitigation in Barcelona, Spain. Another study investigates how municipalities in Denmark and Sweden attempt to integrate 3D models and urban digital twins into their planning workflows. Finally, a multimodal AI-assisted analysis examines approximately 2,700 Instagram posts spanning a three-year period following the July 2021 extreme flooding in western Germany to understand visual narratives of disaster.",
